<section class="team-page">

    <div class="team-header">
        <h1>Process Feedback's Team</h1>
        <p>
            Designers, developers, testers, and supporters who brought Process Feedback to life and keep it vital
        </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="team-subtitle">Active contributors</h2>

    <div class="team-grid">
        {{#each teamMembers}}
        <div class="{{this.cardClass}}">
            <div class="team-name">{{this.name}}</div>
            <div class="team-role">{{this.role}}</div>
        </div>
        {{/each}}
    </div>

</section>

<section class="organizations-section">
    <h2>Organizations that helped us in our journey</h2>

    <div class="organizations-grid">

        
        <div class="organization-card judge-card">
            <div class="organization-logo-wrap">
                <img src="/css/images/judge.png" alt="Judge logo">
            </div>

            <p>
                A heartfelt thanks to Judge0 for providing us with free access to their APIs for about nine months in 2023.
                We no longer use Judge0 as our primary technology but their support allowed us to develop and refine critical
                features during our early stages.
            </p>
        </div>

        
        <div class="organization-card cloudflare-card">
            <div class="organization-logo-wrap">
                <img src="/css/images/cloudflare.png" alt="Cloudflare logo">
            </div>

            <p>
                We are grateful to Cloudflare for their "Cloudflare for Startups" program, which enabled us to kickstart our
                development in 2023. Today, we rely on Cloudflare for most of our technology.
            </p>
        </div>

        
        <div class="organization-card mizzou-card">
            <div class="organization-logo-wrap">
                <img src="/css/images/mizzou-online.png" alt="Mizzou Online logo">
            </div>

            <p>
                Missouri Online played a vital role in helping us design our first user interface. We are especially thankful
                to their team for evaluating our design and offering feedback that helped shape the platform's UI.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>